nw-tent-ground = The entire tent needs solid ground beneath it.
nw-tent-blocked = There is not enough clear space north of you to deploy the tent.
nw-tent-failed = The tent could not be moved. Clear your hands and try again.
nw-tent-deployed = The tent is ready.
nw-tent-pack = Pack tent
nw-tent-occupied = Someone is still inside the tent.
